      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Disaster Recovery & Business Continuity</h1>
      <p>When systems fail, your ability to recover determines the impact on your business. MEAICON designs and implements disaster recovery and business continuity solutions with defined RTO and RPO targets, automated failover, and resilient backup architectures for organisations across the Middle East and Africa.</p>
      <p>We help you prepare for the worst — and ensure that when disruption strikes, your critical operations resume with minimal loss and minimal delay.</p>
